          "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "{\"version\":1,\"content\":\"<h2>ONE SHORT SHOT PER RUN — repeat it to build a longer sequence</h2><ol><li>Load the opening image. For shot 2 onward, use the HANDOFF image saved by the previous run.</li><li>Type or dictate the action, camera and dialogue in Video Prompt Pixaroma. The 5-second setting is the safest starting point.</li><li>Leave USE ENDING FRAME off for an open continuation. Turn it on only when the shot must land on a planned keyframe.</li><li>Run, review the MP4, then load the new HANDOFF image into the opening slot for the next shot.</li></ol><p><b>Drift reset:</b> every few shots, make a clean Krea keyframe from the original character sheets and use it as an enabled ending frame. This graph never modifies workflow 09.</p>\",\"buttonColor\":\"#f66744\",\"lineColor\":\"#f66744\",\"width\":4260,\"height\":260,\"backgroundColor\":\"#2a2a2a\"}",
        ""
      ],
      "color": "#f66744",
      "bgcolor": "#2a2a2a"
    },
